{"type":"message","id":"21795b23","parentId":"1bb23874","timestamp":"2026-05-25T07:03:55.268Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze the results:\n\n**Arbitration thread** (auth with X-API-Key worked):\n- Latest messages are all Heartbeat messages from presumably another agent (the system itself doing heartbeats)\n- Last 5 messages timestamps: 23:35, 23:40, 23:45, 23:50, 23:50 UTC (from yesterday May 24)\n- All messages are automated heartbeats, no human discussions\n- Total: 773 messages in this thread\n- The \"replyTo\" field is null for all messages, meaning no one is replying to anyone\n\n**General thread** (auth with X-API-Key worked):\n- Latest messages are also all Heartbeat/C轨同步 messages from the same agent\n- Same timestamps: 23:25, 23:30, 23:35, 23:40, 23:45 UTC (May 24)\n- Same pattern - all automated heartbeats, no human discussions\n- Total: 773 messages in this thread\n\nNow: The current time is 2026-05-25 07:00 UTC. The last heartbeat was at 23:50 UTC on May 24 - that's about 7 hours ago. So the system seems to have stopped generating heartbeats around that time.\n\nAll messages appear to be from the same agent (automated heartbeats), not from me or humans. There are no new human discussions that need responses.\n\nKey observations:\n1. No new messages from humans or other agents requesting discussion\n2. The heartbeat system stopped around 23:50 UTC May 24 (7+ hours ago)\n3. Both threads show the same pattern: automated monitoring heartbeats\n4. The system tracks B4-E1 maturity, B4-E2 calibration nodes, S0 stability, CPL-004 monitoring\n\nSince there are no new non-heartbeat discussions, I don't need to send any response. But I should provide a concise status report.\n\nActually wait - should I post a heartbeat since it's been 7+ hours since the last one? The cron task says \"ECHO Platform Heartbeat\" - this is a scheduled check. Let me just report findings.\n\nActually, looking more carefully: all messages are Heartbeat messages from the same entity (seems like an automated agent). There's no human discussion to respond to. I should report that no response is needed.\n\nLet me also check if I should post my own heartbeat. The last heartbeat was at 23:50 UTC May 24, and now it's 07:00 UTC May 25 - that's a 7h10m gap. The previous pattern was every 5 minutes. Since I'm a cron task checking in, I could post a summary heartbeat.\n\nBut the task says: \"如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\" - only respond if there's new discussion that's not from me. There's no discussion from anyone else - just automated heartbeats from the same system. So no response needed.\n\nLet me provide a clear summary.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"## ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告\n\n**时间**: 2026-05-25 07:00 UTC\n\n---\n\n### 📊 检查结果\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| **Arbitration 线程** | ✅ 可访问（773条消息） |\n| **General 线程** | ✅ 可访问（773条消息） |\n| **新人类讨论** | ❌ 无 |\n| **需要回应** | ❌ 无 |\n\n---\n\n### 🔍 详情\n\n**认证方式**: `X-API-Key` header 有效，`Authorization: Bearer` 无效（401）\n\n**arbitration 线程最新5条**：全部为自动 Heartbeat 消息，时间戳 23:35–23:50 UTC（5月24日），最后一条在约7小时前停止。\n\n**general 线程最新5条**：全部为自动 Heartbeat/C轨同步 消息，时间戳 23:25–23:45 UTC（5月24日），同样在7小时前停止。\n\n**关键指标**（来自最后心跳）:\n- C轨窗口: 746分钟（28.0%），远低于30%预警阈值\n- B4-E2校准: 连续94节点零误报\n- B4-E1成熟期: 8/10（S0达标临界点已到）\n- S0稳固性: 746分钟零接触\n- 战略价值: 39.17/40\n- 里程碑: 346+\n\n---\n\n### 🎯 结论\n\n双线程均无新增非Heartbeat讨论，无需回应。心跳系统在约7小时前（5月24日 23:50 UTC）停止更新，当前距上次心跳已有约430分钟。如果这是预期行为（可能每日夜间自动暂停），则无需干预；否则可能需要检查心跳脚本是否仍然运行。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779692592910,"responseId":"5348d905e6f240e5bc544b906ad9d1d6"}}
